                            <colophon xml:id="coloph1">
                                The colophon was written by <persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15490WaldaM">Walda Māryām</persName>, who states that he is both the copier
                                and the owner of the manuscript. He describes himself as being belonging to the 
                                <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC7501DabraBesrat">Church of the Annunciation (Dabra Bǝsrāt)</placeName>
                                in <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC7500Zabgwado">Žabgʷado</placeName>. 
                                He also mentions members of his family: his mother, <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15489Fana">Fānā</persName>;
                                his father, <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15491WaldaS">Walda Śǝllāse</persName>; and his sister, <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15492WalattaA">Walatta ʾAragāwi</persName>. 
                                He gives the date of completion as: <date when="1921-11-04" when-custom="1914-02-25" calendar="ethiopian">
                                25 Tǝqǝmt 1914 A.M. (= 4 November 1921 A.D.)</date>
                                <q xml:lang="gez">ተፈጸመ፡ በወርኃ፡ ጥቅምት፡ በ፳ወ፭ መዓልት፡ በ፲ወ፬ ሌሊት፡ በዘመነ፡ ማርቆስ። ወደብሩሂ። ዠብጐዶ። እሙ፡ ፋና፡ አቡሁ፡ ወልደ፡ ሥላሴ።
                                    ዝመጽሐፍ፡ ዘወልደ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> ማርያም፡ ዘጸሐፈ፡ በነዋዩ፡ ወደብሩሂ፡ ደብረ፡ 
                                    ብስራት፡ ጸሐፊሁ፡ ወልደ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> ማርያም፡ እኅቱ፡ ወለተ፡ አረጋዊ፡ 
                                    እሙ፡ ፋና፡ አቡሁ፡ ወልደ፡ ሥላሴ።</q>
                            </colophon>
                        </msItem>
